hich this book was surfaced.\n- The 985 ratings count is directly visible on both the search results and product page, satisfying the ≥20 reviews requirement.\n- The book was successfully \"located\" — the final product page is displayed.\n\nAll three criteria (Japan travel guide, 2024 publication, ≥20 customer reviews) are satisfied.\n\n## Verdict\n**SUCCESS**",
